B.c9e=new A.k("Unable to prepare the secure meeting connection. Check the device date and time and retry.","Impossible de pr\xe9parer la connexion s\xe9curis\xe9e. V\xe9rifiez la date et l\u2019heure de l\u2019appareil puis r\xe9essayez.")
